    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17726" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fartĭlis</span></b> , e, adj.
		farcio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>stuffed</i>, <i>crammed.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anseres,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 22, 27, § 52</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">asinus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 3, p. 187, 6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, in <i>neutr. plur.
				absol.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fartilia,</span>”
				<i>stuffing</i>, <i>mixture</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Val. 27</span></i>
			.</div>
